# Corpora and results are large, regenerable artifacts. The manifest is the
# thing worth committing — it names the exact Tranco list and its checksum, so
# a corpus is reproducible without storing 22MB of domains in git.
corpora/*
!corpora/*.json
results/
*.bin
*.csv

# Anchored: an unanchored "wwwscan" would also match the cmd/wwwscan/ directory
# and quietly exclude the CLI from the repo.
/wwwscan
/dist/
